{"catch":"在像素風幻想RPG中，與靈獸掌控桌遊式成長！","desc":"一千年前，神祇創造了世界與六枚卵。由此誕生的靈獸被託付繁榮，卻反叛而起。神祇震怒，將其封印並消失，只留下人類、神之劍與希望之種。如今命運再起波瀾，新英雄崛起……\n\n體驗懷舊像素風RPG：經典回合制戰鬥、桌遊式成長系統與多樣自訂職業。收集道具、解鎖奇蹟技能，培育會隨劇情進化的靈獸夥伴。轉動輪盤、變強，揭開被封印的真相！","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2026-02-06","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f4ef62e3b3d93bfb6521a552aed74de7cbe0d37efd670843e6ebf99bf1f4b5f8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec4594878822bb257bd3786ca7608ebf0f83e281e2888dc0443f7d0b66fd3cf8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34178e09a9c6991cfe6bae14857281835418e27a11e655185c059f9d27550df1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2233cc23298a9e760727af797c794316a293dd934074e023bc5edfa985f43b07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c6a6310997997bf53b60bfa9ac7c57604f6a2308f88538452ed49d425db2600.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2fddf17eff8ac86187051b60994163e48febfff369e3e5d0358bf901cfe78d4e.jpg"]}